
"smart_sources:ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-technologies/references/wallet.md": {"path":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-technologies/references/wallet.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"tq0k9d","at":1779618284281},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777961476385,"size":54216,"at":1779618284287,"hash":"tq0k9d"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,null]},"outlinks":[{"title":"A sketch of the Wallet icon. The image is overlaid with rectangular and circular grid lines and is tinted blue to subtly reflect the blue in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/485464590c29a6fc839b0a60a3aa2556/technologies-Wallet-intro%402x.png","line":9,"embedded":true},{"title":"Wallet","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/wallet","line":13},{"title":"Passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Passes","line":15},{"title":"`PKAddPassesViewController`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKAddPassesViewController","line":17},{"title":"`addPasses(_:withCompletionHandler:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPassLibrary/addPasses\\(_:withCompletionHandler:\\","line":17},{"title":"Distributing and updating a pass","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/distributing-and-updating-a-pass","line":21},{"title":"`PKAddPassButton`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKAddPassButton","line":23},{"title":"Add to Apple Wallet guidelines","target":"https://developer.apple.com/wallet/add-to-apple-wallet-guidelines/","line":23},{"title":"`Pass`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/Pass","line":27},{"title":"Showing a Pass on the Lock Screen","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/showing-a-pass-on-the-lock-screen","line":31},{"title":"A screenshot of the Lock Screen on iPhone, showing a notification about an upcoming flight.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/cebddf30f9508581b883f85eccdba873/screen-notification%402x.png","line":33,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Lock Screen on iPhone, showing a Live Activity of an upcoming event.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/1fb12c1d6aa8a295ee97a709f68915ef/poster-event-live-activity%402x.png","line":37,"embedded":true},{"title":"Adding a Web Service to Update Passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/adding-a-web-service-to-update-passes","line":43},{"title":"Designing passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Designing-passes","line":45},{"title":"An illustration that represents an iPhone next to an Apple Watch. Each device displays a Wallet pass for a flight.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ab8facb271621ba07477e89c7c65f8a5/pass-intro%402x.png","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"Passes for Apple Watch","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Passes-for-Apple-Watch","line":51},{"title":"Pass styles","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Pass-styles","line":65},{"title":"Passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Passes","line":67},{"title":"A diagram that shows a four-row arrangement of layout areas in a pass. The top row contains a logo, logo text, and an essential area. The second row contains a primary area. The third row contains an area for secondary and auxiliary fields, and the bottom row contains an area for codes and an optional footer.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/84df5c51eeb08eafa967b5fac77e5d86/pass-layout-diagram%402x.png","line":71,"embedded":true},{"title":"`PassFields`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/PassFields","line":73},{"title":"Boarding passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Boarding-passes","line":86},{"title":"An illustration representing a boarding pass that includes a square QR code. The boarding pass is for a flight from SFO in San Francisco to LGA in New York.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/1656e78a2371c7828d25a5c5ffcddad6/boarding%402x.png","line":97,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a boarding pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains primary field areas and an airplane icon. A third row contains an auxiliary fields area. The fourth row contains a secondary fields area. The fifth row contains a footer area. The bottom of the pass contains a barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d9c8d4f88fd387194d5349d1de1f8ede/boarding-pass-layout%402x.png","line":99,"embedded":true},{"title":"Coupons","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Coupons","line":101},{"title":"An illustration representing a coupon pass. The pass includes a company name and icon, glyphs of clothing items, a discount offer of 15% off, and an expiration of June 5, 2023.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69bfb27a52f67ad10eb88d66276d0fa8/coupon%402x.png","line":110,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a coupon pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains a primary field area with a callout labeled 'Strip image'. A third row contains a secondary and auxiliary fields area. The fourth row contains a barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e9ff886bf6d8e3f3202e165f5e0e5889/coupon-pass-layout%402x.png","line":112,"embedded":true},{"title":"Store cards","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Store-cards","line":114},{"title":"An illustration representing a store card pass. The pass includes a company name and icon, a reward point value, an illustration of a coffee cup, a reward value amount, and an updated date.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f81fefc86a3b46a8052c2164131d2583/store-card%402x.png","line":125,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a store card pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains a primary field area with a callout labeled 'Strip image'. A third row contains a secondary and auxiliary fields area. The fourth row contains a barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7b648e914e0e99562fcf512efb115175/store-card-layout%402x.png","line":127,"embedded":true},{"title":"Event tickets","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Event-tickets","line":129},{"title":"`PassFields.AuxiliaryFields`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/PassFields/AuxiliaryFields-data.dictionary","line":133},{"title":"An illustration representing an event ticket pass. The pass includes a company name and icon, a date and time, an illustration of a person bowling, a bowling alley name, and a lane number.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a0a42a2d3a332050cdcaba0eefa6d0ec/event-ticket%402x.png","line":141,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows one layout style for an event ticket pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains areas for primary fields, secondary fields, and a thumbnail. A third row contains an auxiliary fields area. The fourth row contains a barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b43416bbcd92dc2d60485a97d1d94bda/event-ticket-layout-1%402x.png","line":143,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows a second layout for an event ticket pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains a primary field area with a callout labeled 'Strip image'. A third row contains a secondary fields area. The fourth row contains an auxiliary fields area. The fifth row contains a barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/428687f3fc4317c43ecd549547d7606f/event-ticket-layout-2%402x.png","line":145,"embedded":true},{"title":"`SemanticTags`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/SemanticTags","line":153},{"title":"Supporting semantic tags in Wallet passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/supporting-semantic-tags-in-wallet-passes","line":153},{"title":"An illustration representing a poster event ticket pass. The pass includes an event name, a date and time, a background image, seat information, a venue name, and a secondary logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5545e8e95a5b5e9a8c29a25a05e49001/poster-event-ticket%402x.png","line":160,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout style for a poster event ticket pass. The background image is centered in the ticket. The header contains a logo and logo text on the left, and the date and time on the right. The footer contains primary text and seating information, and venue name and region on the bottom left, and a secondary logo on the bottom right.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69231d5f9da8e4f0821934f631aaad1f/poster-event-ticket-layout%402x.png","line":162,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a poster event ticket in the Wallet app with additional ticket information, Maps shortcut, and event guide tiles displayed below the ticket.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/cbcd171b0cd5a3431b0e8996cca7572a/poster-event-in-wallet-app%402x.png","line":166,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the event guide with three quick actions, a weather forecast, and a venue map.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2373cc358447143bdc95bb8b683793bb/poster-event-event-guide%402x.png","line":170,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Pass`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/Pass","line":176},{"title":"`Pass`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/Pass","line":178},{"title":"`SemanticTagType.Seat`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/SemanticTagType/Seat-data.dictionary","line":178},{"title":"An illustration of a poster event ticket with good contrast between the background image and ticket information.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/eb1dcdb8d7e2e2867927fe038db19b9a/poster-event-ticket-good-contrast%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":182,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a poster event ticket with poor contrast between the background image and ticket information.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ad1b01e421bb814d97f375fc1ec7f9db/poster-event-ticket-poor-contrast%402x.png","line":184,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":186,"embedded":true},{"title":"`PassFields.AdditionalInfoFields`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/PassFields/AdditionalInfoFields-data.dictionary","line":188},{"title":"`SemanticTags`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/SemanticTags","line":188},{"title":"`PassFields`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletPasses/PassFields","line":190},{"title":"Generic passes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Generic-passes","line":192},{"title":"An illustration representing a generic pass. The pass is a membership card for a gym, and includes a company name and icon, a membership level, an illustration of a person lifting weights, a policy holder name, a member ID, and a barcode.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2f8c9366433d611399132b3075659cba/generic%402x.png","line":202,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows one layout style for a generic pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains areas for a primary field and a thumbnail. A third row contains a secondary fields area. A fourth row contains an auxiliary fields area. The fifth row contains a rectangular barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0ea8eaf5a48417f07aed39a2e317710e/generic-pass-layout-1%402x.png","line":204,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows a second layout style for a generic pass. A top row contains a logo, logo text, and header field areas. A second row contains areas for a primary field and a thumbnail. A third row contains a secondary and auxiliary fields area. The fourth row contains a square barcode area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/17f44895905b4c1e99b22bdab5c2842f/generic-pass-layout-2%402x.png","line":206,"embedded":true},{"title":"Passes for Apple Watch","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Passes-for-Apple-Watch","line":208},{"title":"A screenshot of a selected flight pass in a list of passes on Apple Watch. The pass includes information about a flight from SFO to LGA. The next pass in the list is a gym membership card with a barcode.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9b54ebf2a350a1e748a38c0b2cc3b74a/watch-card-and-details%402x.png","line":212,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a flight pass on Apple Watch. The pass includes information about a flight from SFO to LGA, and appears above a QR code.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0f74b7b757684a79981367adf14d6adb/watch-pass-design-intro%402x.png","line":216,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the basic layout of a pass on Apple Watch. A top row contains a logo image and an essential field area. A second row contains a primary field area. A third row contains a secondary and auxiliary fields area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/063f7297022ac58ae52b2b9fa2f0121d/watch-layout-diagram%402x.png","line":220,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a boarding pass on Apple Watch. The first row contains a logo image and departure or boarding time information. The second row contains origin and destination information. The third row contains the passenger name and seat.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/70059954f5ceacc74c7fa523ca38459d/watch-layout-boarding-pass%402x.png","line":236,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a coupon pass on Apple Watch. The first row contains a logo image and expiration date. The second row contains a strip image. The third row is unused.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/184da4080f64c5ffa176008657f87e34/watch-layout-coupon%402x.png","line":238,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a store card on Apple Watch. The top first row contains a logo image and an unused area. The second row contains a strip image. The third row contains a member name and number.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d438a08c78a49375fc86caca42894869/watch-layout-store-card%402x.png","line":240,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of an event ticket on Apple Watch. The first row contains a logo image and an event start date. The second row contains information about the event. The third row contains an attendee name and seat location.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4f41a88ccd4e2d10c941e9b49273cd3a/watch-layout-event-ticket%402x.png","line":242,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram that shows the layout of a generic pass on Apple Watch. The first row contains a logo image and an expiration date. The second row contains a strip image. The third row contains a name and number.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f9b2258cd5e574a410899f54f831094a/watch-layout-generic-pass%402x.png","line":244,"embedded":true},{"title":"Order tracking","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Order-tracking","line":246},{"title":"A screenshot of an order fulfillment screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The screen displays information about an order placed, and includes a status bar, shipping address, list of items ordered, and additional order details.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4b6816949b9b5352ebc3fad695086d73/wallet-ot-status-order-placed%402x.png","line":250,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of an order fulfillment screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The screen displays information about an order placed, and denotes that the order was delivered today. The screen includes the shipping address, a link to track the shipment, a list of items ordered, and additional order details.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/c00bddf304d7468dcb19bdf076772174/wallet-ot-status-delivered%402x.png","line":252,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a dashboard that displays an order history screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The screen displays a search field, a list of active orders, and a list of orders placed this month.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a5fe5f2ee6fc90e3e8e299c0f506e5b8/wallet-ot-dashboard%402x.png","line":256,"embedded":true},{"title":"Wallet Orders","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders","line":260},{"title":"A screenshot of an order fulfillment screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The screen displays information about an order placed, and includes a status bar, shipping address, list of items ordered, and additional order details. Callouts identify different fields on the screen, including the merchant logo and display name, the order status and description, the tracking link, and various line items.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e5ec23af37b6a9d9cbc90e5d5f47bf8a/wallet-ot-status-on-the-way-fields%402x.png","line":262,"embedded":true},{"title":"`ApplePayPaymentOrderDetails`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb/ApplePayPaymentOrderDetails","line":264},{"title":"`AddOrderToWalletButton`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/FinanceKitUI/AddOrderToWalletButton","line":264},{"title":"`PKPaymentOrderDetails`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentOrderDetails","line":264},{"title":"description","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/walletorders/order","line":266},{"title":"Displaying order and fulfillment details","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Displaying-order-and-fulfillment-details","line":268},{"title":"logo","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/walletorders/merchant","line":270},{"title":"An illustration of donut, representing a product image. Horizontal and vertical lines extend along the bottom and right side of the image, and include labels that denote the illustration is 300 pixels wide by 300 pixels high.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b0c17d4dfe72b98ca8a2d5e085affccb/wallet-ot-product-images%402x.png","line":274,"embedded":true},{"title":"Displaying order and fulfillment details","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Displaying-order-and-fulfillment-details","line":280},{"title":"`Order`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders/Order","line":284},{"title":"Allowing apps and websites to link to your content","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Xcode/allowing-apps-and-websites-to-link-to-your-content","line":284},{"title":"`LineItem`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders/LineItem","line":286},{"title":"`Order`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders/Order","line":288},{"title":"`Merchant`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders/Merchant","line":292},{"title":"A screenshot of an order detail screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The screen displays a list of donuts ordered. Above the list is an overlay containing buttons to message or email the merchant, get online support, or call customer service.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2aedf894ea8e8d11e1b560725c1c6093/wallet-ot-contacts%402x.png","line":294,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of an order fulfillment screen for a food truck app on iPhone. The top of the screen displays information about an order placed, and denotes that the order arrives tomorrow. The screen includes the shipping address, a link to track the shipment, a list of items ordered, and additional order details. The bottom of the screen displays another order placed, which is ready for pickup. In place of the shipping address is a Barcode button and a pickup address.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bd11abab3cc21427dc4d20a123cbebfa/wallet-ot-status-pickup-details%402x.png","line":307,"embedded":true},{"title":"`ShippingFulfillment`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WalletOrders/ShippingFulfillment","line":311},{"title":"Identity verification","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/wallet#Identity-verification","line":317},{"title":"ID Verifier","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/id-verifier","line":319},{"title":"Requesting identity data from a Wallet pass","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/requesting-identity-data-from-a-wallet-pass","line":323},{"title":"`VerifyIdentityWithWalletButton`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/VerifyIdentityWithWalletButton","line":327},{"title":"`age(atLeast:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKIdentityElement/age\\(atLeast:\\","line":340},{"title":"`PKIdentityIntentToStore`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKIdentityIntentToStore","line":342},{"title":"An illustration of a Verify Age with Apple Wallet button.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7ef983aea59530abf3f038216593ab5d/wallet-button-verify-age%402x.png","line":348,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a Verify Identity with Apple Wallet button.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4e32d4445048f4cea05d1d169e915ba4/wallet-button-verify-identity%402x.png","line":349,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a Continue with Apple Wallet button.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/41c3befed0a2af0868dbcba871a415a2/wallet-button-continue-with%402x.png","line":350,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a Verify with Apple Wallet button.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ac3614b1e4b5622cae8533bbe1749d4d/wallet-button-verify-with%402x.png","line":351,"embedded":true},{"title":"`PKIdentityButton.Label`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKIdentityButton/Label","line":353},{"title":"`cornerRadius`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKIdentityButton/cornerRadius","line":355},{"title":"`PKIdentityButton.Style.blackOutline`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKIdentityButton/Style/blackOutline","line":355},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.